ata-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">题外话</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">（不看也可以，但我希望各位能耐心看完）</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">上低保并不需要那么恐怖的PVP配置！<span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">只需要1-2个点满火的六连刀，带上一个嘲讽盾，5套满级的装备+魂卡+平均B级-A级的附魔，加上你不懈的努力（场次尽量多）</span>，你会发现上低保也并没有那么困难！其实你开局进来点满5个U，练度还是不够上低保，5套满级装备+魂卡这是硬性配置，和点火无关！终究是要花时间养成的东西，为什么不选择一套相对低廉的配置呢？<span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,0,0);\">或许大部分人都不知道自己已经被卷进PVP点火的无底洞了！</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(177,56,206);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623056174626_26081689.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623056174626_26081689.png\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;height:auto;\"></div><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"di