,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623055860857_91015767.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623055860857_91015767.jpg\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;height:auto;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">（2）MY-Osiris</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">嘲讽盾+U六连+U鲜花 手操低保</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623056001883_3479370.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623056001883_3479370.jpg\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;height:auto;\"></div><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">（3）MY—thuzad</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:rgb(177,56,206);font-weight:700;\">双U六连刀+鲁邦，手操暴力暴击队直冲低保</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623056136107_23590781.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1623056136107_23590781.jpg\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;height:auto;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;font-weight:bold;color:rgb(177,56,206);\">还有一张鲁邦前的截图，堪称最低配的15200：</span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><img data-real=\"//